#### Approach
To capture the temporal and spatial characteristics of the dataset resource, I used the `detect_temporal_columns` and `detect_spatial_columns` tools. These tools help identify columns that contain temporal (date/time) and spatial (geographic/coordinate) data, respectively. The tools were chosen for their efficiency in detecting relevant columns, making it easier to analyze and interpret the temporal and spatial coverage of the data.

