The spatial extent for the `Latitude` and `Longitude` columns ranges from a minimum latitude of 54.932913 to a maximum latitude of 83.709847, and from a minimum longitude of 3.420486 to a maximum longitude of 33.015915. The center of the spatial extent is at latitude 77.559738 and longitude 14.974837733333331.

